From 38b4ecf78959694e18071aea00a2a7539d8bd941 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yu Watanabe <watanabe.yu+github@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 28 Mar 2024 10:39:26 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] network: make [DHCPServer] in networkd.conf work

Follow-up for a3ed665a29ea9355c78a2a6b3a032b9504499dd6.

Fixes https://github.com/systemd/systemd/pull/31977#discussion_r1542196572.

Index: b/src/network/networkd-conf.c
===================================================================
--- a/src/network/networkd-conf.c
+++ b/src/network/networkd-conf.c
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ int manager_parse_config_file(Manager *m
                                      "Network\0"
                                      "DHCPv4\0"
                                      "DHCPv6\0"
+                                     "DHCPServer\0"
                                      "DHCP\0",
                                      config_item_perf_lookup, networkd_gperf_lookup,
                                      CONFIG_PARSE_WARN,
